    <briefdescription>
<para>Structured audit event log for GPU operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Records alloc/free/failure/fallback events in an in-process ring buffer. Designed for lightweight compliance tracing: no I/O dependency, no heap allocation per event (the ring buffer is pre-allocated).</para>
<para>Thread safety: all methods are protected by an internal mutex. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
